url: "https://arcassist-decision-buddy.lovable.app/"
abstract: >-
  Early Web-system prototype for evidence-grounded architectural decision
  preparation. The implemented Flask/RAG path retrieves architecture evidence,
  constructs a constrained prompt, and requests draft review material from an
  external LLM service. Decision acceptance remains a human activity.
